    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Lyndsy Evenden",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116346565211082016755/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwC5D-qPkRWdIIbCJFapsgLHW8p-DlxDJJCiLWdomxShOidg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Excellent experience working with Plomberie Borny. George and his team were on time, clean, respectful and very attentive. From initial consultation to the smooth installation of 2 new water tanks, George was professional and had excellent customer service. We felt we were in good hands and would highly recommend.",
        "time": 1769890270,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mira Patoot",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101177239617376289120/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKfczPt6nfZAXJk4uZLAR4jWGHSNsJeUxkbJCnrsDwb5kCByBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We had our hot water tank replaced by Borny Plumber and we are extremely satisfied with their service. The team was very professional, punctual, and efficient. They did a great job and left everything clean and well done. Excellent service from start to finish,\nhighly recommend.",
        "time": 1766168744,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra Lila",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111169845316973727574/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZ3xBicUOZCsb6-hfhYgk2_KySZyQsRpvvzDqPw2uoi3f3EQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The service is truly impeccable. You can trust their expertise; they guide you through every step and make sure you understand exactly what’s happening. I had an emergency with my sink backing up and they came the same day. They analyzed the problem, took pictures, and offered clear recommendations to dig deeper until we get to the real cause.\n\nIt’s a complete, thorough service that’s hard to come by these days. I highly recommend Borny Plumbing for any plumbing issues. They don’t just put a band-aid on the boo-boo — they get to the bottom of it.",
        "time": 1764643014,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105860195243550559770/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1ZpkpCY4tKUQa_pL1SHCmeiLpV3kHN2YY6gTKEpwDfbPVmB_Z=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "I’m extremely happy I hired Borny Plumbing for my home projects. George is a certified professional who handled both small and large jobs at our place. He also gave us preventive advice that saved us thousands of dollars. Highly recommended — I would give 10 stars if I could!",
        "time": 1741215623,
        "translated": false
      },
